    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Level 5 Bastion Facility</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Membership in the Crucible Keepers<br /><strong>Space:</strong> Roomy<br /><strong>Hirelings:</strong> 1<br /><strong>Order:</strong> Empower</p><p>The vent draws heat from deep below to provide energy and power simple machines.</p><p><strong>Empower: Withstand Heat.</strong> For 7 days, the hireling teaches meditative techniques against flames. Any character who trains here at least 8 hours on each of those days gains Heat Tolerant for 7 days: when they take Fire damage, they can take a Reaction to reduce it by 1d4 plus their level.</p><p><strong>Hot Water.</strong> Your basic facilities enjoy a constant source of adjustable heat: a warming table in the dining room, several ovens in the kitchen, a basin of warm water in each bedroom, and so on.</p><p><em>Source: Arcana Unleashed.</em></p>",
